+  <div>
+   <p class="hk-kic">Who is Soner?</p>
+   <h1>Soner Soylu<span>Technique learned on site.</span></h1>
+   <p class="hk-lead">I have been <b>on wind farm sites since 2013</b>, working on the mechanical and electrical systems of Enercon, Nordex, Nordex Acciona and Vestas turbines. Today I am a field service technician with <b>Bilgin Enerji</b> on the Aliağa and Bergama wind farms. On this site I share notes that come from the tower, not from a book.</p>
+   <ul class="hk-roller"><li>Field technician<small>Mechanical · electrical · commissioning · service</small></li><li>Technical thinker<small>Data first, then parts</small></li><li>Problem solver<small>All the way to the root cause</small></li></ul>
+  </div>
+  <figure class="hk-foto"><img src="/assets/saha/sahada-720.webp" width="720" height="960" alt="Soner Soylu in a hard hat and work clothes in front of a turbine" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption><span>On site</span><span>My own photo</span></figcaption></figure>
+ </div>
+ <dl class="hk-sayi">
+  <div><dt>Years on site</dt><dd>13<small>yrs</small></dd></div>
+  <div><dt>Roles</dt><dd>9</dd></div>
+  <div><dt>Manufacturers</dt><dd>4</dd></div>
+  <div><dt>Turbines worked on</dt><dd>300<small>+</small></dd></div>
+ </dl>
+
+ <section class="hk-bol" aria-labelledby="hk-yol-b">
+  <p class="hk-kic">How I work</p>
+  <h2 id="hk-yol-b">Observe, measure, understand, test, solve, learn</h2>
+  <p class="hk-ac">Every step is grounded in a real case from my field notes; follow the link to read the whole case.</p>
+  <ol class="hk-yol"><li><h3>Observe</h3><blockquote>I try to recognise a fault by its sound, vibration and heat before the alarm code tells me.</blockquote><a href="/en/field-notes/yaw-bearing-wear/">Yaw bearing wear caught with no alarm &#8594;</a></li><li><h3>Measure</h3><blockquote>When the control system reading and a physical measurement disagree, I verify the sensor first.</blockquote><a href="/en/field-notes/generator-temperature/">Generator temperature alarm &#8594;</a></li><li><h3>Understand</h3><blockquote>With an intermittent fault I look for the condition it appears in, not the fault itself.</blockquote><a href="/en/field-notes/converter-overcurrent/">Converter overcurrent &#8594;</a></li><li><h3>Test</h3><blockquote>I look at the data before deciding on a part: the vibration spectrum before a blade inspection, a physical measurement of the pitch angle.</blockquote><a href="/en/field-notes/blade-vibration/">Blade vibration &#8594;</a></li><li><h3>Solve</h3><blockquote>I try to fix the problem without stopping production where possible; if needed the turbine keeps running at reduced power until the part arrives.</blockquote><a href="/en/field-notes/converter-overcurrent/">Producing at a 2.2 MW limit &#8594;</a></li><li><h3>Learn</h3><blockquote>I take a lesson from every case and share it as a field note. In the pitch motor case the current rise was visible in the SCADA trend 8 months earlier.</blockquote><a href="/en/field-notes/pitch-motor-high-current/">Pitch motor high current &#8594;</a></li></ol>
+ </section>
+
+ <section class="hk-bol" aria-labelledby="hk-z-b">
+  <p class="hk-kic">Career</p>
+  <h2 id="hk-z-b">13 years in the field</h2>
+  <p class="hk-ac">From tower to site store, from assembly to service: nine roles, most recent first.</p>
+  <ol class="hk-zaman"><li class="simdi"><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2021</b><span>March 2021 – present</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Bilgin Enerji</h3><p class="rol">Field Service Technician</p><p class="tek">Gearbox · converter · yaw · pitch · Aliağa and Bergama wind farms, İzmir</p><p class="sor">Periodic and mechanical maintenance, electrical fault finding. Fault finding on gearbox, converter, yaw and pitch systems; blade inspections and part of the crew on major component exchanges. Commissioning and reporting after service.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2021</b><span>January 2021 – March 2021</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Fu Enerji</h3><p class="rol">Installation Specialist</p><p class="tek">Tower, nacelle and rotor installation · İzmir</p><p class="sor">Mechanical and electrical work on wind turbine installations. Coordinated work with the site crew on tower, nacelle and rotor installation; connection checks.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2020</b><span>September 2020 – November 2020</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Lacivert Vinç</h3><p class="rol">Assembly Technician</p><p class="tek">Vestas V136 3.45 MW · Istanbul</p><p class="sor">Ground and nacelle assembly on Vestas V136 3.45 MW turbines. Mechanical assembly, torque and tensioning, electrical fault finding.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2019</b><span>September 2019 – December 2019</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Genba Energy</h3><p class="rol">Service Technician</p><p class="tek">Acciona 3 MW · 18 turbines · Balıkesir</p><p class="sor">Mechanical and electrical maintenance of 18 Acciona 3 MW turbines at the Çerçikaya wind farm. Mechanical assembly, periodic maintenance and electrical fault finding.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2018</b><span>November 2018 – August 2019</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Siemens</h3><p class="rol">Site Store Supervisor</p><p class="tek">Site store · spare parts · Turkey</p><p class="sor">Materials and spare part management at a wind farm site store. Parts supply to maintenance crews, stock tracking, goods in/out records and shipment coordination.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2018</b><span>April 2018 – October 2018</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Monsson</h3><p class="rol">Service and Assembly Technician</p><p class="tek">Assembly · service · commissioning · Balıkesir</p><p class="sor">Wind turbine assembly and service work. Mechanical maintenance, electrical fault finding, installation and commissioning.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2017</b><span>June 2017 – April 2018</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Hareket Proje Taşımacılığı</h3><p class="rol">Installation and Electrical Technician</p><p class="tek">Tower and nacelle installation · cabling · Istanbul</p><p class="sor">Mechanical assembly and electrical work on turbine installation projects. Tower and nacelle installation, cabling and connection checks.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2016</b><span>October 2016 – April 2017</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>EU Montage Danmark ApS</h3><p class="rol">Service and Assembly Technician</p><p class="tek">Mechanical assembly · electrical fault finding · European sites</p><p class="sor">Wind turbine assembly and service projects in Europe. Mechanical assembly, periodic maintenance and electrical fault finding with international site crews.</p></div></li><li><div class="hk-z-yil"><b>2013</b><span>February 2013 – August 2016</span></div><div class="hk-z-kart"><h3>Enercon GmbH</h3><p class="rol">Steel-Concrete Tower Assembly Technician</p><p class="tek">Enercon · steel-concrete hybrid tower · Turkey</p><p class="sor">Steel-concrete hybrid tower assembly on Enercon turbines. Segment joining, tensioning and mechanical assembly work. My first job in the industry.</p></div></li></ol>
