+ <h1>When the turbine stops, thinking starts</h1>
+ <p class="tsh-lead">Scenarios built from real field cases. Read the alarm and choose the next step yourself. After every choice you see why it was right or premature, what that measurement tells you, and what was actually found on site.</p>
+ <p class="tsh-rozet">Educational simulation · not a substitute for OEM procedures or site safety rules</p>
+ <ol class="tsh-akis" aria-label="Diagnosis sequence"><li>Turbine</li><li>Alarm</li><li>Data</li><li>Observation</li><li>Hypothesis</li><li>Test</li><li>Result</li><li>Root cause</li></ol>
+ <div class="tsh-sec" role="group" aria-label="Choose a scenario"><button type="button" class="tsh-kart" data-s="pitch" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="tshMotor"><span class="n">Scenario 01<span>Nordex N117/3000</span></span><span class="a">Pitch motor high current</span><span class="l">Pitch motor phase current high (Motor A)</span><span class="g">5 decision steps · Case 01</span></button><button type="button" class="tsh-kart" data-s="generator" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="tshMotor"><span class="n">Scenario 02<span>Vestas V126</span></span><span class="a">Generator temperature alarm</span><span class="l">Generator temperature high · 116 °C (threshold 115 °C)</span><span class="g">3 decision steps · Case 04</span></button><button type="button" class="tsh-kart" data-s="converter" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="tshMotor"><span class="n">Scenario 03<span>Vestas V110</span></span><span class="a">Converter overcurrent</span><span class="l">Rotor-side overcurrent / converter fault</span><span class="g">3 decision steps · Case 05</span></button></div>
